WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.828
Angie, Susan, Maria, and Kate went to school every morning by car.

2
00:00:06.829 --> 00:00:09.485
Their parents took turns driving them.

3
00:00:09.486 --> 00:00:13.909
One day, Susan's mother drove the girls.

4
00:00:13.910 --> 00:00:17.701
After they arrived at school, Angie said,

5
00:00:17.702 --> 00:00:21.282
"I don't want to take the math test today.

6
00:00:21.283 --> 00:00:28.516
Let's go to class an hour late."

7
00:00:28.517 --> 00:00:31.641
"Good idea," said Susan.

8
00:00:31.642 --> 00:00:37.574
"I don't want to take the test either."

9
00:00:37.575 --> 00:00:47.510
"Neither do I," said Kate. "I didn't study."

10
00:00:47.511 --> 00:00:51.429
"I didn't study either," said Maria.

11
00:00:51.430 --> 00:00:54.858
"But what are we going to tell our teacher?

12
00:00:54.859 --> 00:01:01.684
He will be very angry if we come late."

13
00:01:01.685 --> 00:01:06.883
"Yes, we need a good excuse," said Angie.

14
00:01:06.884 --> 00:01:10.596
"Oh, that's easy," said Susan.

15
00:01:10.597 --> 00:01:16.919
"We'll say that my mother's car had a flat tire."

16
00:01:16.920 --> 00:01:18.898
All the girls agreed:

17
00:01:18.899 --> 00:01:23.589
it was the perfect excuse.

18
00:01:23.591 --> 00:01:25.995
So, they waited for an hour.

19
00:01:25.996 --> 00:01:30.541
When they arrived at class, the math test was over.

20
00:01:30.542 --> 00:01:33.518
The teacher was very angry.

21
00:01:33.519 --> 00:01:37.847
"Why are you late?" he asked.

22
00:01:37.848 --> 00:01:41.033
The girls all started talking at once.

23
00:01:41.034 --> 00:01:46.420
Finally, Susan said, "My mother's car had a flat tire.

24
00:01:46.421 --> 00:01:51.360
We had to wait for her to fix it."

25
00:01:51.361 --> 00:01:54.752
The teacher nodded and said, "Really?

26
00:01:54.753 --> 00:01:57.999
Maria, sit over there in that corner.

27
00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:01.264
Kate, sit over there in that corner.

28
00:02:01.265 --> 00:02:03.975
Angie, sit here in this corner.

29
00:02:03.976 --> 00:02:09.357
And Susan, sit over there in that corner."

30
00:02:09.358 --> 00:02:13.591
The girls did as they were told.

31
00:02:13.592 --> 00:02:19.185
"Now," said the teacher, "take out a piece of paper and a pen.

32
00:02:19.186 --> 00:02:23.390
Each of you write down which tire Susan's mother fixed."

33
00:02:23.391 --> 00:02:25.929
The girls all looked at each other!

34
00:02:25.930 --> 00:02:29.249
They knew they were in trouble!

